<description>&lt;p&gt;Bomb explosions in southern Thailand injured police and prompted tighter border security and expanded intelligence work, while Thailand is negotiating aviation hub status and cross-border water-pollution mitigation with China. Cambodia is taking the Thailand border dispute to ASEAN and other international forums, receiving U.S. backing, and has detained Cambodians crossing a suspected minefield. Myanmar’s military leader accuses Thailand of facilitating illegal border trade, and a $3 million project will train 4,500 Myanmar refugees for Thai jobs. Malaysia is funding a RM200 million rail link to the border. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPcFFyQ0g2MHFpUUpFWVdPdFpvU3BhZTljZjhjcWc0b1A0MnRscHU5U2t4cVB6a2tjYlBlbElmOHl6cHhWWG9aZVoxOEU0OXBNU0J1ejlQdU1hQmdCc1AyYWJrTXp5T3BVQUVFOFZCa1pEUkpGeDJUNGVXOHJPSDNfeGZMZWNWN1U0cmRnVzYyekUtaThiOG1RQjFsNlVFSXZqUjE1cmJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTFBwQWFvRzFhQnVueEoxQnVnN2N6V0t4OG8wY3dSbmVlNlZGeXctSTZqMUZIQXZPTnl6Tm9JWDNZMk9FdU9hRTdybEZwZThRUnlPdVZURzNqVFlzY3lvckxTVUNmUDZueFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTFAzV2RrOEFkQU4zQmpnTUdmQnhvNmR4VlVCU1hpVHFGeXB1VUFpT1FGNHpVTi0tbk96T3poeVpGUGNvVU0xZGtXS2lsWDlRRnVzdW16REs3VTd5TWZGZ3F0aUNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE1pNzVnekZfd3RGQVFONGpSMWhuanpxYS1FS2pYQ01nTk05N2hFQXR0U1d6T2ltMHp3cDByOHBnWGo2WEtvcmYtLXFnU0FZTDVWRXp3bzRvMURPU3FmLTFoN2dGSFEzNV96d2xnbkxuNjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chiang Rai Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOSl9xRTZDUlZ5MDR0MFJNUDVHbkJ6NTloNGNCNGFEZ2JkVXBjT0p3RmlOb